  "result": "I added `slugify` to `src/cli/slug.ts` and committed it as `619d179`.\n\nIt strips accents, lowercases, and joins words with single hyphens. Leading and trailing separators are trimmed.\n\nThe tests are in `test/cli/slug.test.ts`. They cover basic joining, accent stripping, separator collapsing and trimming, and empty input. All 3 pass, and `tsc --noEmit` and biome are clean. I didn't run the full `npm test` suite or `npm run gate`.\n\nOne limit: letters that aren't accented forms of a base letter, such as Polish `ł`, are kept as they are rather than turned into `l`. My first draft of the accent test used `ł`, and I swapped it out for plain French accents. If you want `ł` and similar letters mapped to ASCII, that needs an explicit mapping.",
